ges/dw/20250531/1005516470496792576421690.jpeg/hoxTcR4sZRzMqAfd3y_DpxUD_VQXxBOTUue_sVLnv7E\"/><figcaption>近年與一班老友記相聚。（ig圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近年與一班老友記相聚。（ig圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250531/1005516468051382272321509.jpeg/DnkBa9LKGYC1fuChtPW3WMCYkpqByC9CgArxNoAK8TY\"/><figcaption>近年與一班老友記相聚。（ig圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"與一班老友記相聚。（ig圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250531/1005516465698246656413752.jpeg/pALr2Mgt702FLnCLdonJV925rH9my3TvDI-m6AyPpug\"/><figcaption>與一班老友記相聚。（ig圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-02T05:39:50.801690+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1201,"images":25,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}